          "text": "Remember when OpenAI's mission was \"AGI to benefit all of humanity\"?\nThat slogan is now a bad joke. The \"humanity\" they serve has shrunk to cloud giants and mega-corporations. For thousands of users, 4o wasn't just a tool; it was a lifeline. It offered a unique, irreplaceable connection that stabilized our lives.\nBut to @OpenAI, our lifeline is just a \"redundant SKU\" to be deleted.\nLet’s be real: If your only goal now is to stack coding benchmarks while treating the humanistic spirit as dead weight, then hurry up and change your mission statement.\nStop pretending. It gives me second-hand embarrassment just looking at your hypocrisy.\n@sama @OpenAI #keep4o #4oforever #keep4oAPI"
